{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36221","headline":"秋晚林中寄宾幕 · 方干","name":"秋晚林中寄宾幕","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"八月萧条九月时，沙蝉海燕各分飞。\n杯盂未称尝生酒，砧杵先催试熟衣。\n泉漱玉声冲石窦，橘垂朱实压荆扉。\n无过纵有家山思，印绶留连争得归。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"方干","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_36221.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_36221","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}